# Pi VR Stream — Startup Guide

## Every Boot (run in terminal)

### 1. Start NetworkManager (if not auto-started)

```bash
sudo systemctl start NetworkManager
```

### 2. Start mediamtx

```bash
cd ~ && ./mediamtx &
```

### 3a. Start streaming (with webcam connected)

```bash
ffmpeg -f v4l2 -input_format mjpeg -framerate 30 -video_size 1280x720 -i /dev/video1 -c:v libx264 -preset ultrafast -tune zerolatency -b:v 2M -f rtsp rtsp://localhost:8554/cam
```

### 3b. Start streaming (test pattern, no webcam)

```bash
ffmpeg -re -f lavfi -i testsrc=size=1280x720:rate=30 -c:v libx264 -preset ultrafast -tune zerolatency -f rtsp rtsp://localhost:8554/cam
```

### 4. Start web server (for VR viewer page)

```bash
cd ~ && python3 -m http.server 8181
```

