## Troubleshooting

**Hotspot not showing up on phone:**

```bash
sudo nmcli con up hotspot
```

**Port 8888 conflict (pigpiod):**

```bash
sudo fuser -k 8888/tcp
```

**Check webcam is detected:**

```bash
ls /dev/video*
v4l2-ctl --list-devices
```

**mediamtx won’t start (port conflict):**

```bash
sudo fuser -k 8889/tcp
./mediamtx
```
